        <mxCell id="rUipnG1zzx824oBMS_Mv-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Chicker Mode Control State Machine&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="420" x="470" y="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rUipnG1zzx824oBMS_Mv-5" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;chg_stop_mode_ctrl - is sent by this state machine to the charge state machine to enable charging or not.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;chg_ok - enables state machine and startup process, from battery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;chg_disable_chip_level == 1 - read by state machine to ensure charging is working. if disabled by charge state machine message pi there is a problemand need substitution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;heartbeat - steady communication between the rpi4 and the chicker board. disables state machine if not communicating.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="130" x="240" y="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
